// The boss's lunge: 80 ticks, the default lunge (docs/architecture.md
// section 11, "模型和动画"): startup 0-35, active 35-45, recovery 45-80.
// Each part has keyframes at its ends. Rotations are YXZ degrees about each
// bone's position along the model's axes; see assets/anims/README.md.
//
// The game moves the node 5 m forward over the active ticks; the clip
// stays in place. 0: standing. 18: crouching, the halberd levelled like a
// spear in both hands, the right hand back. 35: coiled, the point aimed
// ahead and a little right, the right foot far back. 36 to 45: one key a
// tick, the thrust: out in 3 ticks, the legs into a long lunge, then the
// point swept from the right to the left (the hit is a 90 degree sector
// swept right to left). 55: still out. 66: pulling back. 80: standing.
